@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness — deve responder 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness — 200 com banco acessível, 503 com Problem Details quando indisponível
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health/ready
Accept: application/problem+json

### Rota inexistente — deve responder 404 em Problem Details (RFC 7807)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rota-inexistente
